7. TYPE HIERARCHY
CoreGrid supports semantic inheritance.
Example:
text
Entity
 └── Person
      ├── Student
      ├── Teacher
      ├── Researcher
      └── Administrator

And:
text
Entity
 └── GeologicalObject
      ├── Formation
      ├── Deposit
      ├── MineralOccurrence
      └── DrillHole

But inheritance must not become the only semantic mechanism.
CoreGrid also requires composition and traits.

