8. TRAITS
A Trait represents a reusable semantic capability/property group.
Example:
text
Person

may have:
text
Identifiable
Contactable
Locatable
OrganizationMember

A Student might therefore become:
text
Student
+
Person
+
Learner
+
OrganizationMember

This prevents enormous rigid inheritance trees.

